WEBVTT

00:09:59.386 --> 00:10:03.641
from my early forays
as a professional change agent.

00:10:04.308 --> 00:10:08.896
But when I saw the Syrian tragedy unfold,

00:10:08.937 --> 00:10:12.524
a biblical verse, Leviticus 19:16,

00:10:12.566 --> 00:10:15.194
kept reverberating in my brain.

00:10:15.694 --> 00:10:18.989
"Thou shalt not stand idly by

00:10:19.031 --> 00:10:22.409
while the blood of your neighbor
cries out from the earth."

00:10:23.410 --> 00:10:25.537
Well, that's why I got to work.

00:10:26.205 --> 00:10:27.790
I hope you will, too.

00:10:28.624 --> 00:10:29.792
Thank you.

00:10:29.792 --> 00:10:34.630
(Applause)